{"hw":"ἐπιχειρητέον","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐπιχειρητέον</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐπιχειρ-ητέον</span> or <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐπιχειρ-έα</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one must attempt,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μείζοσι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ep.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.18</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <span class=\"gk\">ἐπιχειρητέα</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one must attack,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.118</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.3</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">one must argue dialectically,</b> <span class=\"gk\">πρός τι</span> to a conclusion, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Top.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">120b8</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐπιχειρ-ητέος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">α</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be attempted,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ὅμως δὲ καὶ τοῦτο ἐ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.2.4</span> </span>.</div></div>"}